<section class="section"><div class="container legal-content"><p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 31 October 2026</p><h2>1. About this policy</h2><p>This draft policy describes the intended handling of information submitted through the Apna Cleaning website. The business should review and approve it before launch, especially if additional analytics, advertising, CRM or third-party services are introduced.</p><h2>2. Information you may provide</h2><p>If the enquiry form is enabled, it may request your name, phone number, email address, property location, requirement type and message. Please do not submit payment details, passwords, government identifiers or other sensitive information.</p><h2>3. How information may be used</h2><p>Enquiry information is intended to be used to understand and respond to your request, discuss service availability and provide related follow-up. It should not be used for unrelated marketing without an appropriate basis and any consent required by law.</p><h2>4. Storage and sharing</h2><p>When enabled, the form is designed to email an enquiry to the business recipient configured by the site owner. Email delivery and retention depend on the hosting provider and the business's mail systems. The business should define access controls, retention periods and deletion procedures before enabling the form.</p><h2>5. Cookies and sessions</h2><p>The website uses a basic PHP session to protect form submissions against cross-site request forgery and to display form status messages. No analytics or advertising tracking is intentionally included in this starter build.</p><h2>6. Third-party content</h2><p>Some fonts, icons, map content and illustrative photographs may load from third-party services. Those providers may receive technical information such as your IP address when your browser requests their content. Review the applicable third-party policies.</p><h2>7. Your choices</h2><p>For questions about an enquiry or a request to correct or delete information, contact the business using its confirmed contact details. These contact details will be published on this website after verification.</p><h2>8. Policy updates</h2><p>This draft should be reviewed when the form recipient, hosting setup, privacy practices or applicable legal requirements change. Obtain appropriate legal advice before publication.</p></div></section>
